Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.60,Default,Mireri,0,0,0,,A pop and a step and I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.75,Default,Mireri,0,0,0,,Let's put on another flashy concert today!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.47,Default,All,0,0,0,,Mega-niisan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.13,Default,All,0,0,0,,A patrolling Mega-niisan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.67,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Should you really be playing around, Mega-nii?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.67,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'm not playing around.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.73,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It looks like you are to me-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.23,0:00:30.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time I stole your heart.{consistency with 57}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Autumn is just around the corner.{consistency with  57}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.01,0:00:37.21,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Genius said he'd be back this autumn!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.21,0:00:40.82,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Get out there and catch him so I don't have to worry about winning!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.97,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I've already come up with a way to deal with Phantom Thief Genius.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,That's why I'm patrolling like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.52,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And on top of that, I've put in a request to the Parajuku PriPara Police...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.21,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,...to dispatch the PriPara Police!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.59,0:00:55.17,Default,All,0,0,0,,PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.24,0:02:29.17,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ham and Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.89,0:02:32.52,Default,All,0,0,0,,PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.69,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Our police force is top-notch,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.58,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.36,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And with that, I'll go back to patrolling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.83,0:02:43.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The PriPara Police, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of people will show up?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.41,0:02:52.83,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Candy À La Mode has a new brand for the artist who loves painting pictures.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.83,0:02:57.00,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The cute poppin' Candy À La Mode More fits her perfectly!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.75,0:03:00.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara Change complete!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.98,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.26,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,S-She sure looked like a cute idol...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.14,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A blooming of colour.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.14,0:03:14.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It was a colourful coord.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.93,0:03:17.78,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I've never seen her before-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.78,0:03:20.27,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Could that girl be part of the PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.55,0:03:22.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.76,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's got to be!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.38,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Within minutes of Mega-nii calling the police,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,a new idol appeared.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no refuting my reasoning.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.40,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You could be right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.33,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,So she's with the police-pri...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.73,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,You're dazzling-picasso!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.73,0:03:45.42,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's play-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.93,0:03:47.58,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,There's no way-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.29,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What the heck did she say?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Play?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.10,0:03:51.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.58,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Yehello!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.58,0:03:55.66,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm Kigi Ajimi!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.66,0:03:58.10,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Today is my PriPara début-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,N-Nice to capisce ya.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.96,0:04:01.92,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Hey now!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.95,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Lala's face isn't your sketchbook-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.95,0:04:06.07,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.99,Default,Miron,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.92,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Everything shiny-shiny, frilly-frilly, sparkly-sparkly...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.63,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,and cute-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.16,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Autumn of art.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.16,0:04:28.93,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,So Munch creativity flowing-klimtDaVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.87,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like she's listening.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's sure going about at her own pace.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't paint graffiti on the wall-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.89,0:04:33.43,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Heart jumping dancing-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.42,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,S-She's using a sentence ender, so I guess that makes her a sentence ender idol-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.70,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,She has too many enders.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I haven't a clue what she's saying.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.47,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's crazier than Mirei's pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.47,0:04:48.27,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,At any rate, she seems to be using artist's names-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.66,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Picasso, Da Vinci...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.17,0:04:53.62,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Since she paints pictures, her sentence ender is "daVinci"?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Who the Vinci is Da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.15,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's not who-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.27,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Da Vinci as in the Leonardo from the village Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.27,0:05:03.59,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,What I mean is, Leonardo da Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.67,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,To put it simply, a noteworthy historical artist-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.67,0:05:11.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh? I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.39,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.39,0:05:17.57,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.89,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Look-michelangelo.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.88,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Nice-venusDeMilo!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.86,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Complete-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.48,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.94,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She brought out my cute side!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.69,0:05:31.00,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Creatively original.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Thunderous applause.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.91,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sunflower!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.37,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I can feel the Winds of Andalucia-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.03,0:05:43.16,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing to have you praise me like that-deskel.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.16,0:05:44.96,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It makes me so happy-deskel.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Ajimi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.01,0:05:49.74,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's still hard to understand you, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.52,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,They're pretty good-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.52,0:05:53.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You could use them for wanted posters-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.54,0:05:55.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.66,0:05:59.38,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ajimi, you're with the police, aren't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.38,0:06:01.14,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You don't need to hide it from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.74,0:06:05.70,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You decided to not dress like a policewoman so the culprit wouldn't catch on, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh! That makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.03,0:06:08.36,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Come on, girls...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.99,0:06:14.41,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.58,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Oh my, how terrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.66,0:06:26.29,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This is where the clue was found?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.95,0:06:30.76,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,An eerie picture drawn on the ground...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.35,0:06:32.57,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This is the seventh.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.42,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, Mega-nii!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.68,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Practical jokes are bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.68,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Be a good kid and don't imitate this.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.68,0:06:42.29,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Rina-chan, make it nice and clean.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.03,0:06:46.40,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Rina-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.46,0:06:51.49,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,There have been other jokes like this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.19,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Infuriating!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.19,0:06:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Graffiti is bad-dechin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.11,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So says someone who just drew on a wall-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.53,0:06:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad-houseOfMedici!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.18,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Listen when people talk-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.29,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Bad-completely.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.29,0:07:03.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Plum-delicious.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.77,0:07:07.38,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's possible that this is also the work of Phantom Thief Genius.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.38,0:07:07.92,Default,All,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.98,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.98,0:07:12.82,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well, it's just my intuition.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.82,0:07:16.72,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Don't you think Phantom Thief Genius is the only person who would do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But why are they doing it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.27,0:07:22.27,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well, if we're able to catch them,\Nwe might be able to figure that out.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.27,0:07:24.38,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Let's leave this to the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.98,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now then, I must be off.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.31,0:07:30.37,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.07,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's go catch him!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.07,0:07:32.90,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.90,0:07:35.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Whether it was Phantom Thief Genius or not,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.61,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,what's important is catching the culprit.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.61,0:07:38.50,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Right, Ajimi?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.03,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Important! Noble! Nobleman! Great man!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.03,0:07:43.64,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,A great man is an admirable man-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,To keep peace in PriPara!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's set out!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.96,0:07:50.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.70,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's Gauguin!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.70,0:07:55.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Going My Way!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.04,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's Gogh!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.93,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let it Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.59,0:07:59.93,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,They're competing...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.89,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.89,0:08:10.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero Derosaimu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Meat buns are delicious!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.82,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This autumn appetite-nano!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.82,0:08:16.24,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A suspicious individual has suddenly been found!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.28,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Apprehend her!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.50,0:08:19.07,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.28,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What hast thou done?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I was just drawing my magic circle-dearu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.82,0:08:27.54,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is the autumn of summoning a demon from the depths of hell!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma may be a demon, but she's not bad!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.29,0:08:34.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you want to arrest Aloma, you'll need to give Mikan three pizza buns!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.23,0:08:35.13,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Is three pizza buns all I'm worth to thee?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.72,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Just trying it out-nano! Just trying it out-nano!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.02,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Yet another suspicious individual found!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.93,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Apprehend her!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.59,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko was just drawing a sumo arena-chanko!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.40,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,It's the autumn of sports-chanko!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.70,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Come on, Ajimi, pull it together.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.70,0:08:56.36,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Each one of them have been innocent!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.80,0:09:00.21,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Will you really be able to catch the phantom thief like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.68,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.68,0:09:06.04,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,But why oh why would Ajimi catch the phantom thief-daVinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.53,0:09:09.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why would you?\NYou're with the police, aren't you, Ajimi-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.08,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Porisu?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.19,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Poorisu?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.19,0:09:17.51,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Porokku?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It looks like she's trying to figure something out.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.00,0:09:23.46,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But this seems to be the first time she's reacted to anything we've said.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.18,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Finally-pri?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.35,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi is not police-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.35,0:09:30.65,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't lie!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.65,0:09:33.15,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi is not lying-rousseauDaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.15,0:09:35.21,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're really not?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.27,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.11,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So you're not undercover...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not-uccello!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.68,0:09:41.32,Default,I'm not-uccello!{https,0,0,0,,I'm not the police-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.53,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,See? I told you so-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.66,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.62,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.58,Default,All,0,0,0,,You're not?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So you're not with the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.41,0:10:09.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Then I wonder who is with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.64,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Niyaha-daVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.10,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.84,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Henri-henri?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.84,0:10:18.32,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hold on-henriMatisseDaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.65,0:10:19.56,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.10,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're not with the police, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.99,0:10:28.04,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It'll be impossible for us to catch this mischievous perpetrator in addition to the phantom thief-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.04,0:10:31.94,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It is still too early to give up-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.66,0:10:33.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.75,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's go go go to Christina's World-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.67,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.43,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This is the crime scene from earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.64,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,They sure did clean it up-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.45,0:10:49.20,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is it-daVinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.37,0:10:52.58,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Observing, observing!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.02,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What's important is observing-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.77,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Observing...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.77,0:11:01.23,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Mega-nii and Principal Ookanda already cleaned up the area.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.23,0:11:02.53,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's pointless. Pointless I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.22,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hold on-statueOfDavid.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.28,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,There's more here-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.28,0:11:06.78,Default,Doron,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.78,0:11:07.49,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.99,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Here-daVinci! DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.41,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.51,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What if it was poisoned?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.98,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I was half choking-daVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.92,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,But! But-claudeMonet!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.55,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It all makes sense-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.55,0:11:29.94,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.81,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.93,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,...a sunflower seed-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.93,0:11:36.77,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,A sunflower seed?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.07,0:11:40.68,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What? So you're saying that the culprit is a hamster?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.37,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Isn't that a bit ridiculous?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.37,0:11:42.99,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.77,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.66,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Uh...?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.32,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Oh my?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.71,0:12:06.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,My oh my oh my oh my!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.18,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Leonardo da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.18,0:12:16.34,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,D-D-DaVinci! D-D-D-DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I saw it-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.18,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Thank you, da Vinci-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.41,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.37,0:12:31.83,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.07,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.07,0:12:41.84,Default,Larothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.89,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.30,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A hamster?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.59,0:12:49.04,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Better yet, this!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.10,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.10,0:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the sunflower seed shells-raphael.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sunflower seeds you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.73,Default,Mion,0,0,0,,I get it! Sunflower seeds!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.54,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This hamster! This hamster!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This! This-kokoschkaKandinskyDaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.69,0:13:07.90,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.86,0:13:12.07,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well done, Ajimi-san.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.18,0:13:17.22,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes, those eerie pictures on the ground were created by him.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.22,0:13:18.29,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.60,0:13:20.14,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.14,0:13:25.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You solved the case that was hard to see through like opaque watercolour.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.46,0:13:26.74,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.26,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi did it-raphaelDaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.26,0:13:30.24,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.24,0:13:31.58,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.97,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Explain it properly-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.68,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.64,0:13:42.11,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the inspector that the PriPara Police dispatched upon my request.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.11,0:13:42.90,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.90,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Inspector?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.63,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Him?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.63,0:13:46.75,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.86,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,He's on the look out for Phantom Thief Genius and has been staking out the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.76,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Which is when...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.83,0:14:01.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That means those eerie pictures...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.36,0:14:02.38,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.89,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The sunflower seed shells just\Nhappened to get scattered like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.89,0:14:06.94,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.94,0:14:07.91,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.00,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Will an inspector like him be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.76,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.18,0:14:15.07,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Besides, I've also been patrolling.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.07,0:14:18.29,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai also has other large issues he's responsible for.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.98,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,As such, I thought I should find him a partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A partner?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.41,0:14:28.01,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,If someone was able to figure out that\NHam-senpai created those eerie pictures,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.01,0:14:31.82,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,their insight and observation skills would be of great use to the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.90,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What do you mean-daVinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.90,0:14:35.53,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.49,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's a police badge.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.98,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I can have it-daVinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.98,0:14:45.06,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You've been recognised as his partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.74,0:14:52.87,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please catch the phantom thief as part of the Parajuku PriPara Police.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.87,0:14:58.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,PriPara is a free place where power and money don't hold sway.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.10,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,We must not succumb to anyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.58,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ajimi will do it-chagall!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.58,0:15:08.95,Default,Ajimi will do it-chagall!{https,0,0,0,,If you think Ajimi has the talent to be in the police-daVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.12,Default,Ajimi will do it-chagall!{https,0,0,0,,You got it. You can leave it to Ajimi-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.98,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.21,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'm beyond worried-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.03,0:15:18.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But that is a charm, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.44,0:15:21.47,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Which means that he's also Ajimi-chan's...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.47,0:15:22.87,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Manager?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.28,0:15:28.69,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ajimi-san's police and idol début!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.30,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.72,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What's this-daVinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.72,0:15:36.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The new PriPass, the Cyalume Miracle Pact!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.89,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Like a palette, it's perfect for you who paints pictures.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.44,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,T-T-Thank you-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Ajimi-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.33,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's not fair, not fair at all that only Ajimi gets one!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.33,0:15:51.61,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you will all be getting new PriPasses eventually.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.08,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Additionally, Ajimi-san...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.08,0:15:55.82,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes-easel?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.82,0:15:58.65,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I also have a present for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.12,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What is it-raphael?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.49,0:16:02.13,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,A new song!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.57,0:16:05.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I've warmed it up for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.10,0:16:16.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Good luck with your first concert!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.73,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.73,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan, go, go!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.66,0:16:27.69,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,So an idol is making her début today?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.15,0:16:31.65,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.10,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kigi Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.10,0:16:37.11,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if she could be another princess?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,An art idol, huh?{alt painting}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.07,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of concert it'll be-kuma.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.37,0:16:43.54,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.90,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.91,0:17:58.23,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.78,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Snip, snip!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.13,0:18:10.35,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}It's done!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.01,0:18:14.26,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,660)}Cutout Plushy Kingdom!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.29,0:18:19.91,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,665)}DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.62,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Ajimi-san got blue; pop.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.05,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Happy heart!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.05,0:19:04.09,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Jumping, dancing, cheerful, blazing, fun, heart pounding début concert!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.09,0:19:05.80,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Thank you so much-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.80,0:19:08.35,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,A flower of a smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.67,0:19:12.81,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajiri want's to bloom even more-michelangeloPicassoDaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.48,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That gave me a headache!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.98,0:19:22.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,T-That sure was something, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.44,0:19:26.23,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,As part of the police, I wonder if she'll be able to catch Phantom Thief Genius...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.91,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Best not expect too much out of her-kuma.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.04,0:19:35.04,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Though, you did mention something about her manager being a hamster, right-kuma?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.04,0:19:37.38,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Will the police be okay-usa?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.59,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.05,0:19:42.51,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.72,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai-usa!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.72,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.34,0:19:46.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,W-What?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.52,0:19:50.92,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Everyone, lower your heads-usa!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.52,0:19:50.92,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Everyone, lower your heads-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,This gentleman is...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.72,0:19:57.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...the legendary manager, Ham-senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.33,0:19:58.23,Default,Kusagi,0,0,0,,Or his full name:
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.14,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,This gentleman is...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.72,0:19:57.33,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,...the legendary manager, Ham-senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.33,0:19:58.23,Default-Alt,Kusagi,0,0,0,,Or his full name:
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.61,Default,Kusagi,0,0,0,,Hannibal Caesar Elizabeth Archimedes Newton Duke The Tougou Boss Yujiro Master of Mascots
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.61,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At The New Century We Are The World We Are The Sun Flower Friedrich
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.04,0:20:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,H A M Tarou The Great Golden Selime-senpai-usa!{That's not how you usually spell slime and I doubt such a venerable hamster would be named Slime anyway}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.61,Default-Alt,Kusagi,0,0,0,,Hannibal Caesar Elizabeth Archimedes Newton Duke The Tougou Boss Yujiro Master of Mascots
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.61,0:20:06.04,Default-Alt,,0,0,0,,At The New Century We Are The World We Are The Sun Flower Friedrich
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.04,0:20:10.08,Default-Alt,,0,0,0,,H A M Tarou The Great Golden Selime-senpai-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.62,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,He has a great legacy-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.63,0:20:18.63,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,For instance, he might be able to fit 256 sunflower seeds in his cheek pouch!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,He might be a model for Hamony Land.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.74,0:20:24.01,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's been said that he's been around the world in his hamster wheel.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.47,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,This is that Ham-senpai-usa!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.47,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,This is that Ham-senpai-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.47,0:20:28.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.72,0:20:31.18,Default,Some,0,0,0,,Yeah, wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.99,0:20:34.64,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai, we are at your service-usa!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.99,0:20:34.64,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai, we are at your service-kuma!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.90,0:20:39.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've got a major headache.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.04,0:20:40.86,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll take a break from watching PriPara TV.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.84,0:20:47.53,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.20,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.50,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She seems suspicious-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.87,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She's super flashy and gaudy! It's rather suspicious!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.87,0:20:59.70,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She seems like the phantom thief-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.46,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Investigate! Investigate! Inter interrogate!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.46,0:21:04.67,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Time to check into her-daVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.84,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Dear students,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.84,0:21:16.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce the new art teacher we have appointed.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.64,0:21:20.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.80,0:21:23.00,Default,Others,0,0,0,,She's a teacher?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.82,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's older than us?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.60,0:21:26.84,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Poan!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.97,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Yehellow!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.97,0:21:30.06,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm Kigi Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.06,0:21:34.91,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm your art teacher from here on out-daVinci!
